/release/

#a scratch folder for looking at things (shapefiles and so on); never commit it
/tmp/

#SAFEGUARDED: the financial precarity classification's lookup from area to group (FPC) must never be committed, pushed or published.
#The two folders above (raw-indicators/, work/) already cover it; these rules are a second lock, in case a
#prepared table is ever written somewhere else (tools/prep_neighbourhood.py --out) or a folder is unignored.
/raw-indicators/fpc/
**/nbhd_fpc.csv
**/fpc_final*.csv
**/fpc_label*.csv
